y {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "ae33cd48-4286-533b-a46d-20551d42a300" :question/problem "Calculate $det(R)$ given that\n$$\n\\displaystyle R=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 14 \\\\ -7 & 13\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n$det(R)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(R) & =\\begin{vmatrix}-8 & 14 \\\\ -7 & 13\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(-8)(13)-(14)(-7) \\\\  & =-104+98 \\\\  & =-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510612 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f7510b5f-6370-56f3-aaeb-ffce4ec766ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510621}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f7510b5f-6370-56f3-aaeb-ffce4ec766ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510621} :answer-field/id #uuid "d775c716-9480-511e-b2f7-a5ea4fe55174" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510618}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "b02768f5-2401-5388-9659-b87f57ee6732" :question/problem "Calculate $det(A)$ given that\n$$\n\\displaystyle A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & -12 \\\\ 7 & -15\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n$det(A)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\begin{vmatrix}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{vmatrix}=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =\\begin{vmatrix}7 & -12 \\\\ 7 & -15\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =(7)(-15)-(-12)(7) \\\\  & =-105+84 \\\\  & =-21.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510613 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "de